  "description": "Installation of an air conditioning unit",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The mitigation measures outlined in the approved Noise Impact Assessment document dated 19/11/2025 shall be implemented in full prior to the use of the air conditioning unit hereby approved and shall be retained as such for the duration of its operation.REASON: To safeguard the amenity of residential neighbours.",
    "The rated noise level from the air conditioning unit and ancillary equipment shall not increase the existing background noise level (10dB below) when measured 1m external from the nearest residential or noise sensitive premises. The method of assessment shall be carried in accordance with. BS4142: 2014: Methods for rating and assessing industrial and commercial sound.REASON: To protect acceptable local noise levels.",
    "<p>The development hereby permitted must be begun not later than the expiration of three years beginning with the date of this permission.</p><p><br></p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\nREASON: In order to comply with the provisions of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).</p><p>\r\n</p>",
    "<p>The Development hereby permitted shall only be carried out and completed strictly in accordance with the submitted plans hereby approved and any subsequent approval of details.\r\n</p><p><br></p><p>\r\nREASON: To ensure that the development hereby permitted is carried out in full accordance with the plans hereby approved.\r\n</p>"
